        {
          "book": "ROM",
          "chapter": 6,
          "verse": 1
        }
      ],
      "en": "What shall we say then? Shall we continue in sin, that grace may abound?",
      "ko": "그런즉 우리가 무슨 말 하리요 은혜를 더하게 하려고 죄에 거하겠느뇨",
      "source_text_hash": "10a15e62ab2c24e99846a9872ab6c1e2bd49be385daf2f0f4e5f925db01ba512",
      "translation_text_hash": "02f5c4ab3cf504af04df88e1f2f0550cf52fa80a185089e8f6af4c046ef39943",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그런즉 우리가 무슨 말 하리요 은혜를 더하게 하려고 죄에 거하겠느뇨"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "02f5c4ab3cf504af04df88e1f2f0550cf52fa80a185089e8f6af4c046ef39943"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:ROM:6:2",
      "sequence": 28067,
      "chapter_label": "ROM 6",
      "verse_label": "2",
      "locator": {
